# Local environment & state
.env
.learning/
docs/

# Binary executables built by 'go build'.
# Anchored with a leading slash so they match only the artifacts at the repo
# root. Unanchored, "server" and "gentoken" match at every level and silently
# ignore new files added under cmd/server/ and cmd/gentoken/.
/server
/gentoken
/migrate
*.exe
*.out

# One-off scratch experiments (if created)
cmd/scratch/

dump.rdb

# Anchored for the same reason as the binaries above: unanchored, this would
# also match any nested directory named "benchmarks".
/benchmarks